{"id":"a_rea","lemma":"área","pos":"noun","rank":1078,"glosses":["area (a particular geographic region)","are (SI unit of area equal to 100 square metres)","area, field (the extent, scope, or range of an object or concept)"],"ipa":"/ˈaɾea/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"áreas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/8f/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-%C3%A1rea.wav","examples":[{"text":"Yo estaba en el área.","en":"I was in the area.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/443684","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"¿Conoces bien el área?","en":"Do you know the area well?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/512840","words":[{"g":"to know","l":"conocer"},{"g":"well"},{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"¿Tú eres del área?","en":"Are you from around here?","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"of the"},null]},{"text":"No mucha gente vive en esta área.","en":"Not many people live in this area.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/798341","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"much","l":"mucho"},{"g":"people"},{"g":"to applaud","l":"vivar"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"this","l":"este"},null]},{"text":"La mayoría de la gente vive en áreas urbanas.","en":"Most people live in urban areas.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"majority"},null,null,{"g":"people"},{"g":"to applaud","l":"vivar"},{"g":"in / on"},null,{"g":"urban","l":"urbano"}],"phrases":[[2,4,"of the"]]}]}